=2 Walkthrough
* Participate in one {p:Lair Reive|Reive} in {z:Yorcia Weald}.
** You may join the reive in the middle of the battle as long as you are present for the final evaluation.

!Yorcia Weald Map HQ.jpg||Yorcia Weald Map
* Lair Reives can be found at the following locations:
** (F/G-7) - 2 Loyal Snapweed and 3 Furibund Rafflesia - Bivouac #3
*** Exit North run straight east and take the first left.
** (H/I-6) - 2 Tight-lipped Flytraps and 2 Tenacious Panopts - Bivouac #1
*** Exit North until you pass 2 Saptraps and head east you'll pass 2 Snapweeds. Take a right and head East again to find some Leaflick Lapinion, and eventually find some Cheeky Opo-opo and Saptraps. It's just north from there a bit.
** (J/K-6) - 2 Loyal Snapweed and 2 Tenacious Panopts - Frontier Station
*** Exit to West heading north through the log. Take the first right at the Snapweeds. Next, left just after the next hollow log, right at the 4 Snapweeds, and right at the 2 Corpse Flowers and 2 Snapweeds.{br}You'll enter a big "Room" with 4 Corpse Flowers and the Reive at the back.
** (K-9) - 2 Fervid Funguar and 2 Tight-lipped Flytraps - Frontier Station
*** Exit southeast and hold the left wall. You'll get there eventually.
** (J-11) - 2 Fervid Funguar and 2 Furibund Rafflesia - Bivouac #2
*** Exit and head past the path on the north near the 2 Saplings and the Snapweed till you see a path that heads south near a Droughted Treant. You'll come to a T intersection with a 3rd Treant. Head East from there and the path will slowly point SE as you pass Saptraps and Snapweeds. You should come across a hollowed out log. Head on through and on the south end of this room you should find the Reive.

